{"id":"f0173be2f9b9b066","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-ce-not-decidable.md","title":"CE Set Not Decidable iff Complement Not CE","display":"lem-ce-not-decidable — CE Set Not Decidable iff Complement Not CE","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-ce-not-decidable","aliases":["92-lem-ce-not-decidable"],"display":"lem-ce-not-decidable — CE Set Not Decidable iff Complement Not CE","depends_on":["[[92-df-ce-set]]","[[92-df-decidable-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-ce-not-decidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-ce-not-decidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-ce-not-decidable — CE Set Not Decidable iff Complement Not CE"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b090f61b9f3ec664\" href=\"?note=b090f61b9f3ec664\" title=\"92-df-decidable-set\">92-df-decidable-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\">\\(A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (set parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\)</span> (computably enumerable predicate for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ce\\text{-}not\\text{-}decidable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\Longrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{CE}(\\mathbb N\\setminus A)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ce\\text{-}not\\text{-}decidable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\Longrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{CE}(\\mathbb N\\setminus A)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>r.e.集不可判定 iff 补集不是r.e.</li>\n<li>证明：\n<ul>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>可判定，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N} \\setminus A\">\\(\\mathbb{N} \\setminus A\\)</span>都是r.e.</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{N} \\setminus A\">\\(\\mathbb{N} \\setminus A\\)</span>都是r.e.，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>可判定</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>因此，在前提<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\)</span>下，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(A) \\Longleftrightarrow \\neg\\mathrm{CE}(A^c)\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(A) \\Longleftrightarrow \\neg\\mathrm{CE}(A^c)\\)</span></li>\n<li>对某个已另行证明其定理码集可枚举且不可判定的有效理论，本引理推出该码集的补集不可枚举；这里不对任意所谓“Gödel集”作无条件断言</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"b090f61b9f3ec664","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A \\subseteq \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ce\\text{-}not\\text{-}decidable} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\Longrightarrow\n\\Bigl(\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{CE}(\\mathbb N\\setminus A)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{N} \\setminus A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{N} \\setminus A","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg\\mathrm{Dec}(A) \\Longleftrightarrow \\neg\\mathrm{CE}(A^c)","display":false}],"bytes":1191,"backlinks":[{"id":"58c4ff1898820e8c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["69a2a133da01f9c9","b090f61b9f3ec664"]}